                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1]The good:[/h1]\n\n+ Nice creepy visuals & music\n+ Fairly tense story\n+ Good point & click puzzle gameplay\n+ I like the narrator's item descriptions\n\n[h1]The bad:[/h1]\n- The game can be \"finished\" in 20 mins\n- It has apparently been abandoned by the developers, and this is only the first chapter of the story, so there isn't any conclusion, the plot is just getting properly interesting at the very end of the chapter.\n- There is a bugged achievement (that I spent about 45 minutes going through the save file line by line on my third playthrough to unlock, and it still didn't work. Fuck this shit... I spent more time trying to unlock that single achievement, than playing through the game twice.)",
